. * HYPOTHESIS TEST FOR H4 * 
. 
.         * Please add a verbal description of your model here
.         /*
>         We run a linear probability model with year fixed effects and cluster
>  robust 
>         standard errors at the individual level. 
>         We estimate the conditional effect of having daughters for men by inc
> luding 
>         an interaction term. 
>         
>         */      
. 
.         reg d_gender_eq d_daughter##d_male d_daughter##(c.age c.age_sq i.syea
> r) d_male#(c.age c.age_sq i.syear) , vce(cluster pid) 

